{% comment %}
  Prints "hide" when a section, block or card must not render in the current market,
  and nothing when it may render. Capture it and test for blank:

    {%- capture alc_hide -%}{%- render 'alc-market-visibility', visibility: section.settings.visibility -%}{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- if alc_hide == blank -%} ... {%- endif -%}

  Accepts:
  - visibility: {String} 'all' (or blank), 'ro' (Romania market only) or 'not_ro' (every market except Romania)

  Romania is the store's primary market (handle 'ro', www.alessandrodesign.ro). The check is on the
  market rather than the host, so the dev server, previews and every Romanian domain behave the same.
  Some collections (artificial plants, bathroom furniture) are sold only in Romania.
{% endcomment %}
{%- liquid
  assign alc_is_ro = false
  if localization.market.handle == 'ro'
    assign alc_is_ro = true
  endif

  if visibility == 'ro' and alc_is_ro == false
    echo 'hide'
  elsif visibility == 'not_ro' and alc_is_ro
    echo 'hide'
  endif
-%}
